      "message": "feat(deburr)!: merge main and correct cone contact sizing\n\nMerge upstream/main. Preserve the v75 controller format and migrate Deburr widths at v76. Size each break from the actual cone contacts. Refuse passes outside the tip window before any travel.\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: project version 76 changes the Deburr width parameter from cone setback to contact chord width. Older Deburr project widths are migrated. MCP callers must supply chord width.\n\nRefs #1890",
